works: It takes years, but the markets climb back, and {N} comes out of it with most of what was lost and a harder head for money.
works: {N} loses less than many, and learns exactly what money is for and what it is not.
fails: Half the savings of years are gone, and the plans that rested on them quietly die.
fails: The crash runs on into a long slump, and the savings are only the first thing it takes.
